r\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nRERA Possession December 2028\n\nRustomjee Aden Under Construction \n\n### Rustomjee Aden\n\nby Rustomjee Group (keystone Realtors Limited)\n\nBandra East, Mumbai\n\n₹3.90 Cr - ₹5.42 Cr\n\n2 BHK, 2.5 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nRERA Possession December 2026\n\nRustomjee the Panorama Under Construction \n\n### Rustomjee the Panorama\n\nby Rustomjee Group (keystone Realtors Limited)\n\nPali Hill, Bandra West, Mumbai [...] Single tower, MahaRERA-sanctioned for 44 floors (marketed variously as 37-42 storeys across listing portals), with 240 units total\n Project footprint of just 0.27 acres — among the smallest RERA-registered towers in Borivali East, meaning limited ground-level open space\n Carpet areas run 715 to roughly 1,220 sq.ft. across 2 BHK and 3 BHK configurations\n Originally filed with MahaRERA on 31 July 2017, with a proposed possession of December 2021 — later extended to December 2024\n Rooftop infinity pool and stargazing deck, pitched by the developer as unique to this micro-market\n 800m from Western Express Highway, roughly 1.1 km from Borivali Railway Station","score":0.8364614,"raw_content":null,"id":"f5e963-02"},{"url":"https://housing.com/in/buy/projects/page/38351-rustomjee-summit-by-rustomjee-builders-in-borivali-east","title":"Rustomjee Summit in Borivali East, Mumbai - Price, Reviews & Floor ...","content":"The RERA number for Rustomjee Summit is P51800003590. Buyers can verify the project details using this number on the official RERA website. What is the","score":0.8018276,"raw_content":null,"id":"543777-03"},{"url":"https://www.addressofchoice.com/rustomjee-summit-borivali-east-mumbai-p53830","title":"Rustomjee Summit in Borivali East, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price","content":"Possession at Rustomjee Summit will begin in 2023-06-14, and the project is RERA registered under P51800003590 Units. Developed by Rustomjee Constructions, this","score":0.796562,"raw_content":null,"id":"57eeba-04"},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumba